{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n香港近年掀起一股強勁的手工芝士蛋糕熱潮，從流心焦香巴斯克、日式絲滑凍餅到正宗厚實紐約芝士蛋糕各有捧場客。以下為你整合全港 8 間人氣手工芝士蛋糕小店，無論你想買切件即食或預訂原個蛋糕慶祝都能輕鬆挑選。\n</p>\n<h2>全港8間芝士蛋糕小店推介！</h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_6407514196b0908a043986-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"芝士蛋糕 推介 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_6407514196b0908a043986-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-1_11158408646b09089c70d8e-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"芝士蛋糕 推介 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-1_11158408646b09089c70d8e-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>1.自私蛋糕Cheesy The Goat</h2>\n<p>本地人氣手工網店 Cheesy The Goat（自私蛋糕） 其招牌軟滑芝士蛋糕深受歡迎，嚴選日本及法國忌廉芝士製作，其質地接近慕絲與軟心芝士之間，細膩順滑且帶有清甜奶香；以招牌原味為例，底層是焗得香脆的牛油消化餅底，中間是濃滑芝士蛋糕，頂層再鋪上一層輕盈甜忌廉，一口咬下同時兼顧酥脆與綿滑。人氣口味包括原味軟滑芝士蛋糕、特濃竹炭黑芝麻芝士蛋糕及阿華田芝士蛋糕，款款都是甜品控的至愛。特別推介竹炭黑芝麻芝士蛋糕，是品牌最具代表性的款式之一，店方選用日本黑芝麻，自家研磨成醬，與日本及法國忌廉芝士的溫潤奶香完美融合，吃起來像品嚐極致幼滑的港式芝麻糊配忌廉，濃郁而不覺甜膩。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/277_2688486826b07b399743a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"768\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/277_2688486826b07b399743a2-1024x819.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n竹炭黑芝麻芝士蛋糕 $290– $675（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2106_13017949076b07b36f5cd82.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2106_13017949076b07b36f5cd82-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n阿華田芝士蛋糕 $295 – $680（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/level-the-top-surface-1_8110807736b07b376470e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/level-the-top-surface-1_8110807736b07b376470e7-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n招牌軟滑芝士蛋糕 $270 – $615（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2112_17561833406b07b37a0ee7c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2112_17561833406b07b37a0ee7c-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2114_15745463046b07b383538b6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dayc2114_15745463046b07b383538b6-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>自私蛋糕Cheesy The Goat</p>\n<p>📍 尖沙咀、北角、藍田、荃灣、鑽石山、元朗(朗屏)、茘枝角自取</p>\n<p>門市及網店資訊：<a href=\"https://cheesythegoat.com/zh/pickup-delivery-details/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://cheesythegoat.com/zh/pickup-delivery-details/</a></p>\n<p>備註：蛋糕需提前2日或之前預訂 (4pm截單)，逢星期四-日 有現貨蛋糕</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cheesy_the_goat/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>2.Sbakery by Mama Soo</h2>\n<p>人氣手工烘焙店 Sbakery by Mama Soo 被網民封為「全港最好食紐約芝士蛋糕」，主打傳統美式紐約芝士蛋糕，質感紮實、濃郁且細膩幼滑，其餅底比一般芝士蛋糕更厚身，牛油香氣突出，口感鬆脆紮實。人氣口味包括招牌原味、藍莓芝士蛋糕、檸檬蛋白霜、香蕉拖肥，亦會不定期推出季節限定款式。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_631499272_18429882436187115_8615354553506206450_n_8466804606b0903354a4ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_631499272_18429882436187115_8615354553506206450_n_8466804606b0903354a4ef-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_625046479_18110302723631706_148231391145414554_n_8969568536b090332a69b0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"957\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_625046479_18110302723631706_148231391145414554_n_8969568536b090332a69b0-1024x1021.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Sbakery by Mama Soo</p>\n<p>📍 上環太平山街22-24a號地下B號舖</p>\n<p>📍 太古太古城道18號太古城中心1樓131號舖</p>\n<p>門市及網店資訊：<a href=\"https://sbakerybymamasoo.oddle.me/en_HK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://sbakerybymamasoo.oddle.me/en_HK</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sbakeryhk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>3.Cake Aholic</h2>\n<p>本地烘焙店 Cake Aholic 的芝士蛋糕堅持「少甜低油」與天然海藻糖配方，主打半熟軟心如雪糕般的巴斯克芝士蛋糕，表面帶微焦香氣，切開中心呈幼滑軟心狀態。人氣必食開心果麻糬巴斯克芝士蛋糕，選用意大利100%開心果醬製作，蛋糕絕無色素，香料及添加劑，質地軟滑香濃，仿如雪糕般的口感，搭配自家製拉絲牛奶麻糬及開心果脆脆，層次豐富且輕盈不膩。另一款Tiramisu 巴斯克芝士蛋糕選用意大利馬斯卡邦（Mascarpone）芝士配合即磨 Espresso 咖啡製作，配合自家製吸滿即磨 Espresso 咖啡與 Kahlua 咖啡酒液的手指餅，濃郁咖啡香、酒香與芝士味道互相平衡，少甜不膩。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-1_4487577556b07b3eb10b1c.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-1_4487577556b07b3eb10b1c-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n開心果麻糬巴斯克芝士蛋糕6吋$348（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27_5331085316b07b3f086586.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1273\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27_5331085316b07b3f086586-1024x1358.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-3_10406854356b07b3ee6fa54.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-3_10406854356b07b3ee6fa54-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\nTiramisu 巴斯克芝士蛋糕6吋$348（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-2_14140064916b07b3ecc9abb.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-11-23-at-14.30.27-2_14140064916b07b3ecc9abb-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Cake Aholic</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：觀塘成業街成業工業大廈5樓504室</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期一至日 11:00 – 18:45</p>\n<p>訂購網址：<a href=\"https://www.cakeaholichk.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cakeaholichk.com/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cakeaholiccakery/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>4.21LABO</h2>\n<p>近年在threads爆紅的人氣咖啡甜品店 21LABO，其招牌芝士蛋糕外表看似樸實無華，但中間質地極為幼滑細膩，入口輕盈順滑、完全不會有厚重感。而且定價親民，$58就食到兩件，故被網民封為「世一」芝士蛋糕！除了經典原味外，亦有丸久小山園抹茶及焙茶、特濃朱古力口味等選擇。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-26-5.41.35_17469174676b09042417ad7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"芝士蛋糕 推介 （圖片來源：threads@pro___crastinating授權）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"927\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-26-5.41.35_17469174676b09042417ad7.png\" width=\"892\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads@pro___crastinating授權）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>21LABO</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：旺角山東街32B號U Corner地下G4號舖</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期一至日 09:00-19:00（件裝蛋糕每日11:00起供應）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/21labo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>5.睡飽吃吃</h2>\n<p>西營盤人氣甜品咖啡店「睡飽吃吃」的芝士蛋糕一直都被網民譽為「全港最佳」巴斯克芝士蛋糕。招牌必食西西里島開心果巴斯克，質感軟滑細膩，散發醇厚堅果香，面層淋上香濃開心果醬並撒上開心果碎，開心果味更顯濃郁；其次還有日本九鬼芝麻巴斯克、星野抹茶巴斯克、士多啤梨巴斯克等人氣款式。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_652765202_18097576229003978_4279153526466844333_n_13721567736b090585d035d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_652765202_18097576229003978_4279153526466844333_n_13721567736b090585d035d-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/unnamed_16684522796b090587c2b8b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"564\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/unnamed_16684522796b090587c2b8b.jpg\" width=\"423\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/unnamed_203814216b09058912a07.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/unnamed_203814216b09058912a07.jpg\" width=\"424\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>睡飽吃吃</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：西環西營盤皇后大道西368號地舖</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期一至日13:00 – 18:00</p>\n<p>備註：訂購原個蛋糕@<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wandering_store/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">流浪甜點工作室</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sleepwelleatmore_studio/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>6.La Viña</h2>\n<p>由星級甜品主廚 Ricky Wong 主理的香港知名烘焙品牌 La Viña，其巴斯克芝士蛋糕表面烤出深邃焦香，切開後中心保持極致滑溜的細膩質感，芝士味香濃而不死甜。除了招牌原味外，亦有供應多款特色口味，如伯爵茶麻糬、豆腐麻糬、雙重開心果等，將煙韌麻糬與茶香融入巴斯克蛋糕中。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_652781198_18068081843283271_5202606951919984073_n_4540067316b0905ee87ce1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_652781198_18068081843283271_5202606951919984073_n_4540067316b0905ee87ce1-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_398720482_18005626103290518_4012163142167710765_n_239339456b0905eb18cc2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_398720482_18005626103290518_4012163142167710765_n_239339456b0905eb18cc2-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_490301065_18063693083290518_5995173744417621375_n_5587346606b0905ecc7707.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_490301065_18063693083290518_5995173744417621375_n_5587346606b0905ecc7707-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>La Viña</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：灣仔港灣道6-8號瑞安中心地舖</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期一至六 08:00 – 17:00</p>\n<p>Cupping Room 海港城店📍地址：：尖沙咀廣東道5號海港城海洋中心3樓309號舖<br/>\nCupping Room 觀塘APM店📍地址：觀塘觀塘道418號創紀之城五期(apm)大堂高層15號舖</p>\n<p>訂購網址： <a>www.lavina.hk</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lavina.hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>7.芝士烘</h2>\n<p>近期在threads爆紅的屯門人氣餅店「芝士烘」由前五星級酒店及米芝蓮兩星餐廳甜品廚主理，主打造型極具卡通感的招牌法式「蒸」芝士餅，令不少區外甜品迷甘願專程入屯門排隊一試。蛋糕體透過蒸焗工藝製成，質地比一般芝士蛋糕更滑溜，芝士味極為濃郁，配搭香脆餅底，口感豐富。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_491424459_17906963625105819_415607639421331857_n_10254985736b0906648464f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_491424459_17906963625105819_415607639421331857_n_10254985736b0906648464f-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_490964137_17906963652105819_6869726748667084231_n_7460611796b090662d4e4c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_490964137_17906963652105819_6869726748667084231_n_7460611796b090662d4e4c-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_657374780_18138456550515321_812772537257857316_n_3604253126b090666198fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_657374780_18138456550515321_812772537257857316_n_3604253126b090666198fc-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>芝士烘</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：屯門鄉事會路112-140號Go Go Mall1樓S118號舖</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期二至日 13:30-21:00</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/crazy__cheesecake/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>8.YuMo Cheese</h2>\n<p>有荃灣最強芝士蛋糕店之美譽的「YuMo Cheese」由擁有 15 年三星米芝蓮餐廳及酒店餅房經驗主廚坐鎮，主打全港最多種類款式芝士蛋糕及麻糬巴斯克。店方首創將煙韌軟糯的麻糬融入軟心巴斯克之中，招牌包括手標泰奶茶麻糬巴斯克、小山園宇治抹茶芋泥麻糬，以及生朱古力麻糬巴斯克等，口感豐富且甜而不膩。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_670240112_18331581100218897_8634770900711443527_n_348007096b0907cb83041.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1013\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_670240112_18331581100218897_8634770900711443527_n_348007096b0907cb83041-1024x1081.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_657779794_18155162332455236_1312815049986298087_n_2417605176b0907c977a0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"896\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_657779794_18155162332455236_1312815049986298087_n_2417605176b0907c977a0d-1024x956.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_650909102_18099488195311399_2586060218900716667_n_10586015896b0907c711c65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/saveclip.app_650909102_18099488195311399_2586060218900716667_n_10586015896b0907c711c65-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>YuMo Cheese</p>\n<p>📍門市地址：12:30-20:00</p>\n<p>營業時間：星期二至日 12:30-20:00</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/yumo_cheese/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a>\n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:54.224634+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3106,"images":26,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:45:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:29.198799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:26.537934+00:00","content_hash":"c9d0f399eea825053f190fd0f2cbb3724026ce3d358d2d6030c67433d2a3c51e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}